    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. but the foundation we're applying to is pretty old-school and they really value 'stewardship' and active management. could you add some more detail to the part about managed conservation being a failure? i want to make it clear that their traditional way of doing things is actually doing more harm than good for the species involved.",
